                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/748.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul General
                    Hanna</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Silliman reports Secretary of Treasury states new plan adopted relative mining
                    tax. Official note to Silliman dated August 4, reads as follows:</p>
                <p>[Quotes from Mr. Silliman’s August 6.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
